lost-and-found-3f - License
===========================

This repository is distributed under a split license.

  * Section A (MIT License) governs the source code - the game engine, app,
    build scripts, and pipeline tooling.
  * Section B (Reserved Rights) governs the author's creative works - the
    scenario and story text, and the project's own generated art and audio
    deliverables.
  * Section C governs bundled third-party fonts (SIL OFL 1.1) and points to
    the third-party audio credits.

Where a single file straddles the boundary (for example a scene data file in
TypeScript), the code structure is governed by Section A and the scenario /
dialogue text contained in it remains governed by Section B.


